  "destination": "SG",
  "name": "S Pass",
  "summary": "Singapore's work pass for skilled workers, below the Employment Pass salary floor. The employer applies, must meet an age-based minimum salary of at least $3,300 a month, and is limited by a quota on how many S Pass holders it can employ.",
